## 11. SSE and notifications

- **Token.** `POST /events/token` returns an HMAC-signed short token (user, company, exp = 60 min). `GET /events?token=` validates it.
- **Stream headers:** `Content-Type: text/event-stream`, `Cache-Control: no-cache`, `Connection: keep-alive`, `X-Accel-Buffering: no`. No compression.
