  - new notifications;
  - report and bundle progress;
  - breaker state changes;
  - badge recomputation, debounced 5 s.

  All are emitted through `NOTIFY sp_events` and fanned out per company and audience.
- **Notification sources:** signals (§6.3), report and bundle ready (to the creator), retention run summaries and held calls (owner/admin), STT paused/resumed (everyone), and amoCRM disconnected, detected by the sync job. Dedupe per day and rule. Retain 90 days.

