  negatives: {
    key: 'bad_audio' | 'penalties' | 'short' | 'no_answer' | 'bad_leads';
    today: number; last7: number[];                          // last7[6] = today (same window)
    vsYesterdayPct: number | null;                           // same window
    vsLastWeekPct: number | null;                            // vs the average of the previous 7 days, same window
    target: DeepLink | null;                                 // an /audio list reproducing exactly the counted calls; null if not expressible
  }[];
  load: {
    hours: { hour: number; count: number | null }[];         // same hour set as analytics day buckets; null = future
    intervals: { from: number; to: number; count: number; sharePct: number }[];
      // 3-hour bands over the same hour set, `to` exclusive (e.g. 21→24 covers 21:00–23:59); the last band may be shorter
    peakHour: number | null;
    tip: Msg | null;                                         // rule-based
  };
  funnel: { stages: { label: string; count: number }[]; overallPct: number | null } | null;  // amoCRM month to date; null when not connected
  signals: Signal[];                                         // max 4, sorted bad → warn → good, then by magnitude
}
interface Signal { id: string; severity: Tone; title: Msg; detail: Msg; metric: string; target: DeepLink | null }
```

Index formulas (each 0–100; a missing input makes that index `null`):

- `activity` = 50 × (active operators ÷ operators) + 50 × min(1, calls today ÷ average of the last 14 working days up to the same time)
- `conversion` = min(100, conversion ÷ target × 100)
- `quality` = average score10 × 10
- `discipline` = operators meeting the daily norm ÷ operators × 100

